; Split-horizon zone for git.peetvandesande.com.
;
; Publicly a CNAME to ruby (vps-5ca50660.vps.ovh.net), which reverse-proxies
; it to forgejo over wgclient1 - homelab/forgejo/ruby. Inside the lab it
; resolves to forgejo itself, so the one URL Forgejo knows itself by
; (ROOT_URL, clone URLs, SSH_DOMAIN) works from both sides and LAN traffic
; never leaves the house. forgejo serves a lab-CA certificate carrying this
; name, so a device that does not trust the lab CA warns here and not
; outside.
;
; git over SSH works only on this side: off the LAN the name is ruby, whose
; :22 is ruby's own sshd.
;
; The zone is deliberately the SINGLE NAME, not peetvandesande.com, and needs a
; matching addNTA() on Delphi or every lookup here SERVFAILs.
;
; GENERATED by dns/ansible - do not edit this file by hand.
; The source is dns/ansible/group_vars/all.yml. Change it there and run
;   cd dns/ansible && ansible-playbook zones.yml
; which rewrites this file, bumps the serial only if the contents changed,
; pushes it to Pythia and reloads just this zone.
$TTL 3600
$ORIGIN git.peetvandesande.com.

@       IN  SOA pythia.home. hostmaster.home. (
                2026102801  ; serial
                3600        ; refresh
                900         ; retry
                604800      ; expire
                3600 )      ; negative TTL

@       IN  NS      pythia.home.

@       IN  A       192.168.8.62             ; forgejo
@       IN  AAAA    fd33:5692:1834:1000:be24:11ff:fe14:eca4 ; forgejo's ULA
